WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.500
Do yourself a favour today: solve ten questions.. In TFNG, do not fill gaps from

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:15.500
your own knowledge: that is NOT GIVEN.. Before answering, mark the keyword in

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:23.500
the question.. In Matching Headings, read the whole paragraph, not just the

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.500
first line.. In gap fill, decide the word type first: noun, verb or adjective..

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.500
In TFNG, treat absolute words as traps.. In multiple choice, eliminate

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.500
distractors instead of guessing.. Do not over-invest: never spend more than

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.500
ninety seconds on a question.. Answer easy questions first and leave hard ones

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:03.500
for last.. In word matching, hunt for synonyms and antonyms..
